                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>每次转入下一阶段，问一个具体问题</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>下一位参与者拿到这些材料，能否开展他的工作？</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 620, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 12 }}>

            <Box style={{ width: 620, height: 104, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 8, padding: '0 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
